### Feature Product — CREATE
### JWT + RBAC (desde el ISS-13): requiere el token de un usuario con la concesión
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "brand": "TechBrand",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "min_stock": 5,
  "quantity": 50,
  "product_type_id": 1,
  "status": "active"
}

### CREATE con las claves camelCase que envía el frontend (minStock, productTypeId)
# @name createProductCamelCase
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mouse Inalámbrico",
  "brand": "TechBrand",
  "price": 25.5,
  "minStock": 10,
  "quantity": 80,
  "productTypeId": 1
}

### 404 — el tipo de producto no existe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Producto huérfano",
  "brand": "Sin marca",
  "price": 10,
  "min_stock": 1,
  "quantity": 5,
  "product_type_id": 9999
}
